# Public customer website's URL (no trailing slash), e.g. https://sai-communication.in
# Used to build real, working links to it from the admin — e.g. the Service
# Feedback page's WhatsApp/copy-link actions (src/pages/ServiceFeedback.tsx).
# Leave unset until the domain is purchased: those actions show a clear
# "not configured" fallback instead of a fake link. Set this the moment the
# domain exists — no code change needed.
# VITE_CUSTOMER_SITE_URL=
